Data License
============

The flight and telemetry data in this directory (flights.parquet,
telemetry.parquet) and the derived site data in site/src/data/ are built
from public ADS-B transponder broadcasts.

Records from 2026-10-27 onward are derived from adsb.lol open data
(https://adsb.lol, https://github.com/adsblol), (c) adsb.lol contributors.
That data, and this database insofar as it is derived from it, is made
available under the Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/

Any rights in individual contents of the database are licensed under the
Database Contents License: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/

If you publicly use or redistribute this data or a database derived from it,
you must:
  - attribute "adsb.lol contributors" and this project
    (https://github.com/jjcaine/cpd-helicopter);
  - keep any adapted database you distribute under the ODbL; and
  - not apply technical measures that restrict ODbL rights.

Records through 2026-10-26 were collected from ADS-B Exchange
(https://globe.adsbexchange.com) historical traces.

The source code in this repository is licensed separately.
